  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      170.85,
      203.21,
      392.85,
      226.91
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE CHARTERED INSTITUTE OF TRANSPORT OFSRI LANKA (INCORPORATION) ACT, NO. 8 OF 2000",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      240.41,
      401.88,
      288.95
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the Corporate members of the Chartered Instituteof Transport of Sri Lanka incorporated under the CharteredInstitute of Transport of Sri Lanka Act, No. 08 of 2000 haspassed a resolution to amend the name of said Institute:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      302.45,
      401.91,
      350.99
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Institute, for the purpose of giveneffect to the said resolution, has applied to change the nameof such Institute and it will be expedient to grant suchapplication:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      364.37,
      401.91,
      388.19
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      401.57,
      401.88,
      437.75
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Chartered Institute ofTransport of Sri Lanka (Incorporation) (Amendment) Act,No. of 2021.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      451.13,
      401.91,
      561.71
    ],
    "text": "2.In every context in which the Chartered Institute ofTransport of Sri Lanka is mentioned (whether by that nameor by the name \u201cChartered Institute of Transport of Sri Lanka\u201dor by the abbreviation \u201cInstitute\u201d) in the Institute of CharteredInstitute of Transport of Sri Lanka Act or any notice or otherdocument issued under that Act, there shall, unless the contextotherwise requires, be substituted for the expressions\u201cChartered Institute of Transport of Sri Lanka\u201d, the expression\u201cChartered Institute of Logistics and Transport of Sri Lanka\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      575.21,
      401.89,
      673.31
    ],
    "text": "3.Every contract, agreement or other instrument ordocument whatsoever made, issued or executed prior to thedate of commencement of this Act, by or in favour of the\u201cChartered Institute of Transport of Sri Lanka\u201d shall bedeemed on and after the date of commencement of this Act tobe and to have been made issued or executed by or in favourof the expression \u201cChartered Institute of Logistics andTransport of Sri Lanka\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      402.19,
      441.58,
      411.26
